      "author": "PavelPeng7",
      "description": "## Focus Workbench 0.1.3\r\n\r\n### Improvements\r\n\r\n- Restricted vault access to the folders configured in Focus Workbench instead of enumerating every file in the vault.\r\n- Added GitHub Artifact Attestations for release assets, so users can verify build provenance.\r\n- Added `package-lock.json` for reproducible builds.\r\n- Removed `!important` declarations to improve compatibility with Obsidian themes and user styles.\r\n\r\n### Privacy\r\n\r\nFocus Workbench remains fully local-first. It does not make network requests, collect telemetry, or upload vault content.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/PavelPeng7/obsidian-ultra-dashboard/compare/0.1.1...0.1.3",
