      "author": "PavelPeng7",
      "description": "## Focus Workbench 0.1.1\r\n\r\nFocus Workbench is a local-first workspace for managing tasks, focus time, ideas, and knowledge notes in Obsidian.\r\n\r\n### What’s new\r\n\r\n- Renamed the plugin from **Pavel Dashboard** to **Focus Workbench**.\r\n- Updated the plugin ID to `focus-workbench`.\r\n- Updated view, command, and settings labels to use the new name.\r\n- Refined the plugin description for public release.\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n\r\n- Dashboard for focus tasks, idea capture, and knowledge notes.\r\n- Task workbench with today, active, in-progress, overdue, and completed views.\r\n- Markdown frontmatter-based task editing and completion.\r\n- Local focus timer stored directly in task notes.\r\n- Optional `.base` file support for task scoping.\r\n- No network requests, telemetry, or external data upload.\r\n\r\n### Privacy\r\n\r\nFocus Workbench is local-first. Your notes and task data remain in your Obsidian vault.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/PavelPeng7/obsidian-ultra-dashboard/commits/0.1.1",
